            <div xml:id="d479">

                <pb facs="0609" n="524" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg524"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.73/20: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bundy</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-02-19T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19,
                                1919, 3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your February 4, 11 a.m.</p>
                <p>Was German cable cut between Monrovia and Canary Islands since cutting of cable
                    north of Canary Islands and is it now available for <pb facs="0610" n="525"
                        xml:id="pg525"/> messages to Europe and America via Cadiz at reasonable
                    rates. Was German cable between Monrovia and Togoland cut and is it now
                    available for messages.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
